{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》現已登陸Xbox和PS5平台，這是一款規模極其龐大的遊戲。但不要以為它只是一個空有面積、缺乏細節的開放世界。R星在《GTA6》中加入了比以往任何作品都更加豐富的細節，其中包括一些令人驚嘆的動作動畫。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586988.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:24:33.547459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:02:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_hash":"a53bf8f31b1c66ff320645c3236433349c51e7e4e440d080af2efc67584ec19b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}